{"info":{"author":null,"author_email":"LanceDB Devs <dev@lancedb.com>","bugtrack_url":null,"classifiers":[],"description":"# lance-namespace\n\nLance Namespace interface and plugin registry.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis package provides:\n- `LanceNamespace` ABC interface for namespace implementations\n- `connect()` factory function for creating namespace instances\n- `register_namespace_impl()` for external implementation registration\n- Re-exported model types from `lance_namespace_urllib3_client`\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install lance-namespace\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```python\nimport lance_namespace\n\n# Connect using native implementations (requires lance package)\nns = lance_namespace.connect(\"dir\", {\"root\": \"/path/to/data\"})\nns = lance_namespace.connect(\"rest\", {\"uri\": \"http://localhost:4099\"})\n\n# Register a custom implementation\nlance_namespace.register_namespace_impl(\"glue\", \"lance_glue.GlueNamespace\")\nns = lance_namespace.connect(\"glue\", {\"catalog\": \"my_catalog\"})\n```\n\n## Creating Custom Implementations\n\n```python\nfrom lance_namespace import LanceNamespace\n\nclass MyNamespace(LanceNamespace):\n    def namespace_id(self) -> str:\n        return \"MyNamespace { ... }\"\n\n    # Override other methods as needed\n```\n\n## License\n\nApache-2.0\n","description_content_type":"text/markdown","docs_url":null,"download_url":null,"downloads":{"last_day":-1,"last_month":-1,"last_week":-1},"dynamic":null,"home_page":null,"keywords":"lance, lancedb, namespace, vector-database","license":"Apache-2.0","license_expression":null,"license_files":null,"maintainer":null,"maintainer_email":null,"name":"lance-namespace","package_url":"https://pypi.org/project/lance-namespace/","platform":null,"project_url":"https://pypi.org/project/lance-namespace/","project_urls":{"Documentation":"https://lance.org/format/namespace/","Repository":"https://github.com/lance-format/lance-namespace"},"provides_extra":null,"release_url":"https://pypi.org/project/lance-namespace/0.13.0/","requires_dist":["lance-namespace-urllib3-client==0.13.0"],"requires_python":">=3.8","summary":"Lance Namespace interface and plugin registry","version":"0.13.0","yanked":false,"yanked_reason":null},"last_serial":41042250,"ownership":{"organization":null,"roles":[{"role":"Owner","user":"jackye1995"}]},"urls":[{"comment_text":null,"core-metadata":{"sha256":"96d3478ebe7f3ff59af997522481d730fef3a8345cd457791364e9eef91cb889"},"digests":{"blake2b_256":"e747cfa33cca1ba7c749fd2918cfc5c8ded788f378cc6424d23e4fead5a14125","md5":"4ae4e2a9210ed5af93620752fb10f046","sha256":"438c7b17aef421c21c138196e715f2510d62f07e865372047f87c1e75e618c7a"},"downloads":-1,"filename":"lance_namespace-0.13.0-py3-none-any.whl","has_sig":false,"md5_digest":"4ae4e2a9210ed5af93620752fb10f046","packagetype":"bdist_wheel","python_version":"py3","requires_python":">=3.8","size":13507,"upload_time":"2026-09-14T02:47:01","upload_time_iso_8601":"2026-09-14T02:47:01.765655Z","url":"https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/e7/47/cfa33cca1ba7c749fd2918cfc5c8ded788f378cc6424d23e4fead5a14125/lance_namespace-0.13.0-py3-none-any.whl","yanked":false,"yanked_reason":null},{"comment_text":null,"core-metadata":false,"digests":{"blake2b_256":"c0e7d5d46594678ee479c0eda830c47b2f5c46133bd100e84e9aa6e01306eca7","md5":"281dd37fa9b428a4e44875f21e02c848","sha256":"24554a0997bdb39595c6e4cb3ac6722069f6cd3bd1a74e7acbba7bfaf774a40d"},"downloads":-1,"filename":"lance_namespace-0.13.0.tar.gz","has_sig":false,"md5_digest":"281dd37fa9b428a4e44875f21e02c848","packagetype":"sdist","python_version":"source","requires_python":">=3.8","size":11636,"upload_time":"2026-09-14T02:47:03","upload_time_iso_8601":"2026-09-14T02:47:03.871523Z","url":"https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/c0/e7/d5d46594678ee479c0eda830c47b2f5c46133bd100e84e9aa6e01306eca7/lance_namespace-0.13.0.tar.gz","yanked":false,"yanked_reason":null}],"vulnerabilities":[]}
